{"completed": true, "response": "这不是他突然冒出来的想法。他对一个亲近的人有一份心事，已经想了很久，也清楚自己想向对方表达什么。他迟迟没有开口，不是因为还没想清楚自己的心意，而是因为他知道，一旦说出来，两个人的关系就会发生变化。此刻，他心里已经有了明确的答案，只是还没有真正说出口，让两个人一起面对这件事。正是因为这份心意很重，而关系的变化又还没有真正发生，所以他一直没有开口。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ab2c14d-24e4-49c4-b617-a4c6679e4480", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002746297828Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:27:53.558268+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a554d6e37a5cf118d6fef9a701eaa77e37e8c9daf8f915d6f4eaa7b9b7b8d745", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002746297828Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"pr